{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13069","headline":"和王相公题中书丛竹寄上元相公 · 郎士元","name":"和王相公题中书丛竹寄上元相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多时仙掖里，色并翠琅玕。\n幽意含烟月，清阴庇蕙兰。\n枝繁宜露重，叶老爱天寒。\n竟日双鸾止，孤吟爲一看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}